<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Last week I sent something to you that has been very impactful for business owners I have worked with in the community. While sales, finance, operations and technology typically get most of the attention from business owners, I believe leaders should move human capital to the top of their priority list.<br />
<br />
Getting a human capital management strategy right, by implementing 10 key strategies for business success, helps leaders stay focused on the big picture, get tighter control of expenses, minimize risk exposure, and maximize opportunities for revenue generation. With your own company’s prosperity in mind, which of the 10 key strategies do you need to focus on? Click on the<b> link to my calendar</b> to pick a time for me to give you a call so we can discuss your take on these key areas of your business.<br />
